---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import IndustryResources from '../../components/IndustryResources.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Beverages" lang="en" heroTitle="Beverages" heroSubtitle="From application conditions to a purchasing specification">
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">Evaluate botanical ingredients in the actual beverage, not just in water. Clarity, taste and storage behavior depend on the complete formula and process.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Troubleshooting and validation</h2><div class="space-y-5">
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Haze or sediment</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Compare dissolution and dispersion at your target pH, water hardness and use level. Check the influence of carrier, filtration and mixing order before changing the ingredient.</p></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Bitterness or color drift</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Run sensory and color checks after heat treatment and during storage in the intended package. Compare small use-level steps without assuming one grade suits every beverage.</p></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Process mismatch</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Include pasteurization or hot-fill conditions in pilot trials. Assess shelf-life and microbial controls with your formulation and quality team.</p></div>
</div><div class="mt-10 p-8 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What to include in your brief</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">Beverage format, pH, process temperature/time, clarity target, use level and destination market.</p><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Also include the ingredient, first order quantity and documents needed. Grades, samples and documents are subject to availability; certification and regulatory suitability require product- and market-specific review. These are evaluation considerations, not a formulation or suitability guarantee.</p><a href="/request-quote?request=application" class="inline-block mt-5 px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">Discuss application requirements</a><a href="/resources/downloads" class="inline-block mt-5 ml-4 text-primary underline">Get the sourcing checklist</a></div>
</div></section>
<IndustryResources lang="en" industry="beverages" />
</PageLayout>
